msgid ""
msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: zh_CN\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: 8b5d9fb947703f6f26ae9c45b9d094763c07394352ea8926002c021cdf19d9e9\n"

msgid "Bounded UART hardware FIFO bytes"
msgstr "有界的 UART 硬件 FIFO 字节收发"

msgid "Select `irq-fifo-bytes` when an exact H743 or U575 assembly needs hardware FIFO buffering with an explicit bound on each interrupt's byte work. The provider uses the existing public UART face, caller-owned TX requests and a static RX byte ring. It creates no task, worker, allocation or second owner. Threshold batching does not establish physical latency or loss-free throughput. The independently selected `irq-fifo-rtscts-bytes` mode adds hardware RTS and CTS on an explicit four-pad software-reference route, as described below."
msgstr "当精确的 H743 或 U575 装配需要硬件 FIFO 缓冲，并要求明确限制每次中断处理的字节工作量时，可选择 `irq-fifo-bytes`。provider 使用现有公共 UART 接口、调用方持有的 TX 请求和静态 RX 字节环，不创建任务、worker、动态对象或第二个所有者。按阈值分批处理不代表已取得物理时延或无丢失吞吐量保证。独立选择的 `irq-fifo-rtscts-bytes` 模式在明确的四引脚软件参考路由上增加硬件 RTS 和 CTS，详见下文。"

msgid "Select the exact controller and clock"
msgstr "选择精确的控制器与时钟"

msgid "![FIG-16: current static generation, typed lookup and private I/O ownership; FIFO selection retains one UART owner](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-16：当前静态生成、定型查找和私有 I/O 所有权；FIFO 选择仍仅有一个 UART 所有者](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"

msgid "FIG-16: current static generation, typed lookup and private I/O ownership; FIFO selection retains one UART owner"
msgstr "FIG-16：当前静态生成、定型查找和私有 I/O 所有权；FIFO 选择仍仅有一个 UART 所有者"

msgid "**FIG-16 shows current construction and runtime ownership, not FIFO timing or silicon qualification.** The factory returns one `nx_uart_port_t`. Its selected readonly table calls a private provider built from one shared compile-time algorithm and exact-family official LL leaves. The arrows retain their generation, lookup and call meanings; no forwarding-only runtime layer is added."
msgstr "**FIG-16 展示当前构造与运行时所有权，不表示 FIFO 时序或硅片资格。** 工厂返回 一个 `nx_uart_port_t`。选中的只读方法表调用私有 provider，后者由一份共享的编译期 算法和精确系列的官方 LL 叶操作组成。箭头仍分别表示生成、查找和调用，不增加 仅作转发的运行时层。"

