msgid "The extra RDR stage matters: FIFO depth is not the complete RX backlog. The TX shifter is also separate. This selection does not change FIFO-disabled ordinary UART or DMA modes. F407/F470 and other UART IPs do not inherit FIFO support from the public API. H743 high-clock profiles, U575 Secure execution, DMA, block/word RX, non-8N1 frames and low-power/autonomous operation remain outside both FIFO selections. Ordinary `irq-fifo-bytes` remains flow-none."
msgstr "额外的 RDR 级不能忽略：FIFO 深度不等于完整的 RX 积压容量。TX 移位寄存器也是独立的。本选择不改变关闭 FIFO 的普通 UART 或 DMA 模式。F407/F470 和其他 UART IP 不会从公共 API 自动继承 FIFO 支持。H743 高频配置、U575 Secure 执行、DMA、块／字 RX、非 8N1 帧和低功耗／自主运行仍不在这两种 FIFO 选择的范围内。普通 `irq-fifo-bytes` 仍不启用流控。"

msgid "These full inputs use the existing Board routes. The FIFO subsection belongs to the same authored assembly and typed IR as all other resources."
msgstr "这些完整输入使用现有 Board 路线。FIFO 子节与其他资源来自同一份手写装配配置 和定型 IR。"

msgid "Select hardware RTS and CTS explicitly"
msgstr "明确选择硬件 RTS 和 CTS"

msgid "`irq-fifo-rtscts-bytes` retains the same public byte face and selected FIFO state layout. Its distinct readonly operations table selects a compile-time specialization of the same algorithm. No extra mutable flow flag, per-instance clock field, queue, task or worker is added to either FIFO or ordinary UART."
msgstr "`irq-fifo-rtscts-bytes` 保留相同的公共字节接口和选配 FIFO 状态布局。它使用独立的只读方法表，选择同一算法的编译期特化版本，不为 FIFO 或普通 UART 增加可变流控标志、实例时钟字段、队列、任务或 worker。"

